# Keep the build context small and free of secrets. `.env` files must never be
# baked into an image; production reads configuration from the platform's
# environment panel instead (see .env.example and docs/deployment.md).
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/npm-debug.log*
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
docs
